    <entry key="customDescription" type="xstring" value="Exercise 2, simplified against Canvas on 10 Oct 2026: 18 nodes, 17 connections. Q1 one histogram with editable bins and manual table inspection; Q2 exact-inch scatter and directly averaged size/category bar charts; Q3 technology GroupBy, two bar charts, and one energy Pivot with grouped chart. Optional Star2 comparison reuses the Pivot/chart. No repeated brand cleaning, extra CSV exports or duplicate exploration branches. Teaching snapshot: 15 Feb 2026; 4,508 Available Australian registration records. See README and GenAI declaration; execute and verify in KNIME."/>
